        "text": "**KNIGHTS OF LEGEND**\n\n**IMPERIAL KNIGHTS** models from your army have the Feel No Pain 6+ ability. In addition, at the start of your Command phase, each **IMPERIAL KNIGHTS** model from your army regains 1 lost wound."
