          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **IMPERIAL KNIGHTS** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot or fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack, if there are no other friendly units within 9\" of your unit, re-roll a Hit roll of 1 and re-roll a Wound roll of 1."
      },
      "Stratagem§Survivor of Strife": {
