          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Movement phase, just after an enemy unit ends a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move.\n\n**TARGET:** One **IMPERIAL KNIGHTS** model from your army that is within 8\" of that unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your model can make a Normal move of up to D6\"."
      },
      "Stratagem§Thin Their Ranks": {
        "keywords": {
