        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ARMIGER** model from your army, or one **IMPERIAL KNIGHTS TITANIC** model from your army, and one or more friendly **ARMIGER** models affected by that model’s Bondsman ability.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by your **ARMIGER** models have the **[RAPID FIRE 1]** ability."
      },
      "Stratagem§Thunderstomp": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Imperial Knights",
