          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase, when a friendly **IMPERIAL KNIGHTS TITANIC** unit is **destroyed** by an enemy unit.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly **ADEPTUS MECHANICUS** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** That enemy unit is **marked** until the end of the battle:\n\n- While a unit is **marked**, friendly **ADEPTUS MECHANICUS** units’ attacks that target that unit can re-roll **wound rolls**."
      },
