      "Stratagem§Honoured to Serve": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase, when a friendly **ARMIGER** unit has shot.\n\n**TARGET:** That **ARMIGER** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Those attacks do not prevent your unit from being **eligible to start an action**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Imperial Knights",
            "Throne-Bonded Outriders"
