        "text": "While this unit is not Battle-shocked, add 3 to its Objective Control characteristic."
      },
      "Ability§Mastery of Obduracy — Sentinel of Orthodoxy (Virtuous)": {
        "text": "While this unit is not Battle-shocked, add 5 to its Objective Control characteristic."
      },
      "Ability§Mastery of Clarion — Truth’s Voice (Aspiring)": {
        "text": "Pilot of a TITANIC unit only. Each time this unit uses its Bondsman ability, it can select a friendly ARMIGER unit that is within 18\" of and visible to this unit."
      },
      "Ability§Mastery of Clarion — Nuncio of Obligation (Esteemed)": {
        "text": "Pilot of a TITANIC unit only. Each time this unit uses its Bondsman ability, it can select a friendly ARMIGER unit that is within 24\" of and visible to this unit."
      },
      "Ability§Mastery of Clarion — Emissary of the Court (Virtuous)": {
        "text": "Pilot of a TITANIC unit only. Each time this unit uses its Bondsman ability, it can select a friendly ARMIGER unit that is anywhere on the battlefield and visible to this unit."
      },
      "Ability§Mastery of Tuition — Wise Mentor (Aspiring)": {
        "text": "At the end of each battle, if this unit gains any XP, you can select one other IMPERIAL KNIGHTS unit from your Crusade army that survived that battle. The selected unit gains 1XP."
      },
      "Ability§Mastery of Tuition — Martial Tutor (Esteemed)": {
        "text": "At the end of each battle, if this unit gains any XP, you can select up to two other IMPERIAL KNIGHTS units from your Crusade army that survived that battle. The selected units gain 1XP."
      },
      "Ability§Mastery of Tuition — Master-At-Arms (Virtuous)": {
        "text": "At the end of each battle, if this unit gains any XP, you can select up to three other IMPERIAL KNIGHTS units from your Crusade army that survived that battle. The selected units gain 1XP."
      },
      "Ability§Mastery of Ambush — Predator’s Prescience (Aspiring)": {
        "text": "After both players have deployed their armies, you can redeploy this unit."
      },
      "Ability§Mastery of Ambush — Foe Hunter (Esteemed)": {
        "text": "After both players have deployed their armies, you can redeploy this unit and one friendly IMPERIAL KNIGHTS ARMIGER unit."
      },
      "Ability§Mastery of Ambush — Trailmaker (Virtuous)": {
        "text": "After both players have deployed their armies, you can redeploy this unit and one friendly IMPERIAL KNIGHTS unit."
      },
      "Ability§Mastery of Condemnation — A Duty of Censure (Aspiring)": {
        "text": "Once per battle, at the start of your Shooting phase, select one enemy unit within 18\" of and visible to this unit. Until the end of the phase, each time an IMPERIAL KNIGHTS unit from your Crusade army makes an attack that targets that unit, you can re-roll a Hit roll of 1."
      },
      "Ability§Mastery of Condemnation — Noble Orator (Esteemed)": {
        "text": "Once per battle, at the start of your Shooting phase, select one enemy unit within 18\" of and visible to this unit. Until the end of the phase, each time an IMPERIAL KNIGHTS unit from your Crusade army makes an attack that targets that unit, you can re-roll a Hit roll of 1 and you can re-roll a Wound roll of 1."
      },
      "Ability§Mastery of Condemnation — High Denunciator (Virtuous)": {
        "text": "Once per turn, at the start of your Shooting phase, select one enemy unit within 18\" of and visible to this unit. Until the end of the phase, each time an IMPERIAL KNIGHTS unit from your Crusade army makes an attack that targets that unit, you can re-roll a Hit roll of 1 and you can re-roll a Wound roll of 1."
      },
      "Ability§Mastery of Joust — Landstrider (Aspiring)": {
