        "text": "Add 2\" to this unit’s Move characteristic. This unit is eligible to shoot in a turn in which it Advanced."
      },
      "Ability§Mastery of Joust — Foe’s Bane (Virtuous)": {
        "text": "Add 2\" to this unit’s Move characteristic. This unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Advanced."
      },
      "Ability§Mastery of Mechanisms — Iron Bloodline (Aspiring)": {
        "text": "In your Command phase, you can select one friendly IMPERIAL KNIGHTS model within 6\" of this unit. That friendly model regains up to D3 lost wounds."
      },
      "Ability§Mastery of Mechanisms — Blessed by the Sacristans (Esteemed)": {
        "text": "In your Command phase, you can select one friendly IMPERIAL KNIGHTS model within 6\" of this unit. That friendly model regains up to 3 lost wounds."
      },
      "Ability§Mastery of Mechanisms — Knight of the Cog (Virtuous)": {
        "text": "In your Command phase, you can select one friendly IMPERIAL KNIGHTS model within 6\" of this unit. That friendly model regains up to D3+3 lost wounds."
      },
      "Ability§Mastery of Execution — Harbinger (Aspiring)": {
        "text": "At the start of the first battle round, select one enemy unit. Until the end of the battle, each time this unit makes an attack that targets that enemy unit, add 1 to the Damage characteristic of that attack."
      },
      "Ability§Mastery of Execution — Headsman (Esteemed)": {
        "text": "At the start of the first battle round, select one enemy unit. Until the end of the battle, each time this unit makes an attack that targets that enemy unit, add 1 to the Damage characteristic of that attack and that attack has the [sustained hits 1] ability."
      },
      "Ability§Mastery of Execution — Master of Judgement (Virtuous)": {
        "text": "At the start of the first battle round, select one enemy unit. Until the end of the battle, each time this unit makes an attack that targets that enemy unit, add 1 to the Damage characteristic of that attack and that attack has the [sustained hits D3] ability."
